---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Research
description: Case studies, insights, and open work from PraxisIQ — real-world examples and analysis at the intersection of AI, product, and higher education.
---

<section class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="tagline">Research</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Work, thinking, and what we're learning.</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">Case studies from real engagements, analysis of what's changing in AI and education, and open resources for the community.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="case-studies">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">Case studies</h2>
    {% if collections.caseStudies.length %}
      <div class="card-grid">
        {% for study in collections.caseStudies %}
          <a href="{{ study.url }}" class="card reveal" style="text-decoration: none;">
            {% if study.data.badge %}
              <span class="card-badge card-badge--{{ study.data.badgeType or 'enterprise' }}">{{ study.data.badge }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            <h3>{{ study.data.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ study.data.summary }}</p>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="card" style="max-width: 480px;">
        <p class="text-muted">Case studies from current engagements are coming soon. In the meantime, <a href="/about/#contact">book a call</a> to discuss how we've helped organizations like yours.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--subtle" id="insights">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">Insights</h2>
    {% if collections.insights.length %}
      <div class="card-grid">
        {% for post in collections.insights %}
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="card reveal" style="text-decoration: none;">
            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.8125rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">{{ post.date | dateFormat }}</p>
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="card" style="max-width: 480px;">
        <p class="text-muted">Insights and analysis are on the way. Follow along on <a href="{{ site.linkedin.personal }}">LinkedIn</a> for early takes.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="open-work">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Open work</h2>
    <p style="max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--n700);">Talks, datasets, open-source tools, and other resources shared publicly. Building in the open is how we build trust.</p>
    <div class="card" style="max-width: 480px;">
      <p class="text-muted">Open resources are being prepared. Check back soon or <a href="{{ site.linkedin.personal }}">connect on LinkedIn</a> for updates.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
